  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "雲端運算與服務",
    "sub_ename": "CLOUD COMPUTING AND SERVICES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要以實務與商業應用的角度切入介紹雲端運算與服務，以AWS Educate為學習內容與平台。課程內容為基本雲端服務原理及架構、應用案例與實務操作等，包括AWS基礎系統架構、雲端資料庫服務、與資料查詢與分析工具等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to provide a comprehensive overview of cloud computing and services with business perspective and practical cases. It mainly introduces the concepts of cloud computing and service, principles and architecture, use cases, and applications, which including AWS basic system architecture, cloud database services, data query and analysis tools and etc.",
